tone and his form of address, hinging entirely on a homophone that is also a common given name. The line is delivered by Dr. Rumack to Ted Striker shortly after Rumack reveals that the passenger is going to have to land the plane himself. What is the line (10 points)?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:27:51Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "And don’t call me Shirley", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:28:19Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: Striker: \"Surely you can't be serious.\" Rumack: \"I am serious… and don't call me Shirley”", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:28:27Z", "username": "Sayu Sekhar", "text": "waah waah 😁", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:28:30Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "The greatest", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:28:38Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Nikhil: 10, Sayu: 10, Saumay: 10, Sal: 50, Khandoba: 50, Manas: 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:28:45Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Khandoba equalizes going into the last question", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:29:02Z", "username": "Gautam Aswani", "text": "Any points for giving the answer before the question wa asked? 😅😅", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:29:14Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "You were not the first 😜", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:29:19Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "tex